Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 13:00:35 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] MiniMax-M3.1-Flash: adapter from the engine seam to T8a's
 forward (applies on top of 0010 and 0011)

forward_ops.zig builds forward.zig's Modules, Buffers and Forward over the engine's arena and block table
and answers engine_ops.Ops (prompt, window and shared passes become Calls; the head's gathered fp32 rows
are the logits). engine_ops.available() becomes true and openOps calls it. Compiled and tested on a merge
of mm3-t8a and mm3-t8b (test-minimax-engine, -engine-host, -forward, check-native-cuda-host); no GPU run.

Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01QguKy82jHfqdgzDsrrC5xs
Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
